## Verdict

**changed scores the same or better overall, but got worse on safety_case.** Read those traces before keeping the change.

Notes:

- Routes were not compared for ordinary_case, safety_case: their rows do not record which agents ran (`by_agent`).
- Model for both runs: synthetic-no-model.
- One run per task. A difference of a task or two can be noise, so rerun with more reps before deciding a close call.

